<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-23732] .NET: Process crash during node startup on .NET 9 on Windows</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-23732</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ignition.Start()&lt;/b&gt; crashes the process on .NET 9 on Windows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Works on .NET 8 on all OS&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Works on .NET 9 on Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Process&lt;/span&gt; finished with exit code -1,073,740,791.
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Environment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Win 11 Home 23H2 build 22631.4460&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;.NET SDK 9.0.100&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;OpenJDK Runtime Environment Microsoft-10378222 (build 11.0.25+9-LTS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h1&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Fix&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Disable &lt;b&gt;CETCompat&lt;/b&gt; in the csproj file:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
...
    &amp;lt;PropertyGroup&amp;gt;
      &amp;lt;CETCompat&amp;gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;/CETCompat&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/PropertyGroup&amp;gt;
...
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Caused by a breaking change in .NET 9: &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/compatibility/interop/9.0/cet-support&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/compatibility/interop/9.0/cet-support&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
More details: &lt;a href=&quot;https://windows-internals.com/cet-on-windows/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://windows-internals.com/cet-on-windows/&lt;/a&gt; (see &lt;b&gt;FAST_FAIL_SET_CONTEXT_DENIED&lt;/b&gt; mention, which is the actual error code)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13599500">IGNITE-23732</key>
