                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17900003" author="ptupitsyn" created="Thu, 21 Nov 2024 11:06:10 +0000"  >&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fails at this line in JVM: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/microsoft/openjdk-jdk11u/blob/release/jdk-11.0.25_9/src/hotspot/cpu/x86/vm_version_x86.cpp#L618&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/microsoft/openjdk-jdk11u/blob/release/jdk-11.0.25_9/src/hotspot/cpu/x86/vm_version_x86.cpp#L618&lt;/a&gt; (get_cpu_info_stub call in get_processor_features method)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fails on jdk-21.0.5.11 too&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Visual Studio shows &quot;Unhandled exception at 0x00007FF806B148C6 (ntdll.dll) in Runner.exe: Unknown __fastfail() status code: 0x0000000000000030.&quot; exception&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="17900016" author="ptupitsyn" created="Thu, 21 Nov 2024 12:06:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workaround&lt;/b&gt;: disable CET in the project file&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&amp;lt;CETCompat&amp;gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;/CETCompat&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/compatibility/interop/9.0/cet-support&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/compatibility/interop/9.0/cet-support&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Details - see &lt;b&gt;FAST_FAIL_SET_CONTEXT_DENIED&lt;/b&gt; (corresponds to  __fastfail() status code: 0x0000000000000030) mentions in &lt;a href=&quot;https://windows-internals.com/cet-on-windows/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://windows-internals.com/cet-on-windows/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17900315" author="ptupitsyn" created="Fri, 22 Nov 2024 10:16:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=igusev&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;igusev&quot;&gt;igusev&lt;/a&gt; please review: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/11677&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/11677&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
